            "review_title": "Review at Driftwood Pool Bar",
            "review_text": "Ariana Huynh\nVietnam1 contribution\n0\nI had good experience at Driftwood bar\nOct 2025 • Friends\nMy two friends and I were staying at the hotel and received a voucher to enjoy some drinks at Driftwood. Even though we came quite late and wanted to sit in the garden, the staff were really friendly and cheerful. One of them, Luan, was especially thoughtful — he brought us a bottle of mosquito repellent because he was worried we might get bitten, and also checked if we needed anything else. Overall, it’s definitely a place worth coming back to for another experience.\nRead more\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 28, 2025",
